    "Scan of the 1982 edition of the Southport, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1978; aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1977; last revised in 1982; printed in 1992.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 22.9 x 27.8 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
